# Keeps this directory tracked in git.
#
# Dockerfile does `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public` for the
# standalone build (Next.js's own convention for static assets served
# outside the app - see node_modules/next/dist/docs/.../output.md). Docker's
# COPY fails the whole build if the source path does not exist, and this app
# currently has no /public assets (the favicon is an inline data: URI in
# app/layout.tsx) - so this file exists purely to keep the directory present
# for that COPY to succeed. Safe to remove once real static assets live here.
